('pat_035', 'Tanvi Sharma', 25, 'Female', '+9198151354', '+9198151354', 'Street 29, Sector 8, Shimla, HP', 'O+', 'Chronic Lumbar Radiculopathy (L4-L5 Disc Herniation)', 'Follow prescribed medication doses strictly, monitor daily symptom logs, and reach out to the clinic if discomfort arises.', '[{"name":"Gabapentin 300mg","dosage":"1 capsule","frequency":"TID with meals"},{"name":"Thiocolchicoside 4mg","dosage":"1 tablet","frequency":"BD post meals"},{"name":"Paracetamol 650mg","dosage":"1 tablet","frequency":"SOS for back ache"}]'::jsonb, '["History of Chronic Lumbar Radiculopathy","Routine annual blood panels within acceptable range","No documented contraindications"]'::jsonb, '["No known drug allergies (NKDA)"]'::jsonb, '{"name":"Contact for Tanvi","relation":"Family","phone":"+9198151399"}'::jsonb, '2026-10-11', 'Spine Care & Nerve Pain Follow-up', 'Tanvi Sharma (25y Female): Assess radiation of pain down the leg, numbness in toes, walking tolerance, and absence of cauda equina red flags.', '["Is the shooting pain or numbness still traveling down into your leg or foot?","Have you experienced any loss of bladder or bowel sensation, or numbness in the groin area?","How far are you able to walk comfortably before needing to sit down?"]'::jsonb, '["Any sudden loss of bladder/bowel control is an emergency (cauda equina) requiring immediate ER care.","Avoid prolonged sitting and do gentle core-stabilization exercises as guided by PT.","Apply moist heat to the lower back for 15 minutes before gentle stretching."]'::jsonb),
